OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FBecoming
OL,6,Fdrier during the evening, with
OL,7,Fremaining blustery showers becoming
OL,8,Fincreasingly isolated and mainly
OL,9,Faffecting the Peak District. Becoming
OL,10,Fchilly under more lasting clear
OL,11,Fspells, with these more likely in the
OL,12,Feast.
OL,13,
OL,14,CFriday:FMainly fine initially, with
OL,15,Fsunny spells and the odd shower.
OL,16,FShowers fading but cloud thickening
OL,17,Finto the afternoon, with spells of
OL,18,Frain in places and brisk winds
OL,19,Fgenerally. Near-average temperatures.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
