OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FBreezy
OL,6,Fand rather cloudy at times Saturday,
OL,7,Fwith a little rain. Sunday likely
OL,8,Fbrighter overall. Likely turning more
OL,9,Fsettled and warmer for a time from
OL,10,FMonday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
